---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SocialBar from '../components/SocialBar.astro';
---
<Base title="About LaneCash" description="Practical money, crypto, hustles and scam alerts for Nigeria.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About LaneCash</h1>
    <p>Practical finance education for people who need clear steps, not hype.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>What we publish</h2>
    <p>LaneCash focuses on everyday money skills: side hustles, wallets and payouts, beginner crypto safety, POS realities, and scam patterns common in Nigeria.</p>
    <p>We write for operators and beginners who want mechanisms, costs, risks, and weekly actions — not get-rich-quick claims.</p>

    <h2>How to use this site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Read a guide fully before acting.</li>
      <li>Treat every naira figure as a range, not a promise.</li>
      <li>Use official apps and links only.</li>
      <li>Never share OTPs, seed phrases, or remote phone control.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p><strong>LaneCash is for education only.</strong> Nothing here is financial, investment, legal, or tax advice. Markets, fees, and app policies change. You are responsible for your own decisions and losses.</p>
    <p>We do not guarantee income. Any example earnings are illustrative and can be zero in real life.</p>

    <h2>Contact & community</h2>
    <p>Follow LaneCash on the platforms below for updates. Official links are managed from our team settings.</p>
  </div>

  <SocialBar />
</Base>
